        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Bibliografía comparada:   \n- CHECCOLI, Anna : \" Ventagli cinesi giapponesi ed Orientali \", Edizioni Tassinari,Firenze, 2009,p.45.  \n-FILIPPINI SACHETTO, Amalia; TESTONI SASSI, Lidia: Un soffio di vanità. Ventagli da collezione private italiane, 1989, De Luca Edizioni d´Arte, pp.78-79,nº 35.   \n- HUTT, Julia: Chinese fans y fans from de China en Fans from the East, England, Debrett´s Peerage Ltd., 1978, p.33,nº10.  \n-MERINO DE CÁCERES, Maruja: Orientals fans in the National Museum of Decorative Arts in Madrid. En: FANS, The Bulletin of Fan Circle International. Londres, 2007, nº 85 pp. 22-29.  \n- MERiINO DE CÁCERES; Naruja: \"The Fan Collection of the Nacional Museum of Decorative Arts in Madrid\" en FANS, The Bulletin of The Fan Circle International. Spring-Summer 2001."@es ;
